Below is one possible fix. The underlying problem is that a long, unbroken string (with no white‐space) will never wrap unless you explicitly allow breaking inside words. We can add some CSS to the shared Heading component to permit breaking long words. This change will apply across all Headings (including the PageHeader title) without you having to alter every consumer.

